    "final": "The lowest price anyone charges for size XS of the Wexcombe tee, among those that can actually be bought, is $12.61 from Dovercourt Apparel (http://localhost:7770/igr-tcl-09.html, 'Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee, Short Sleeve'). Verified end-to-end: size XS is selectable/in-stock on the product page, and adding it to the cart charged exactly $12.61 (Subtotal $12.61). Note: some sellers advertise an XS 'Promo' price in the size dropdown (e.g., Marchmont 'Promo $10.91', Kettering 'Promo $11.34', Grantley 'Promo $25.74', Northwick 'Promo $14.23', Elmsworth 'Promo $28.55'), but those are display-only labels; the actual checkout price uses the per-variant price embedded in the page (e.g., Marchmont XS charged $14.54 in cart, not $10.91). Among the 28 sellers where XS is truly purchasable, prices were: Dovercourt $12.61, Haldane $14.11, Kettering $14.25, Marchmont $14.54, Dalston $14.67, Oakfield $15.40, Northwick $15.86, Fairhaven $17.51, Ingleton $18.96, Alderney $19.32, Yarrow $20.31, Dunmore $20.33, Gisburn $24.38, Quarles $24.58, Larkspur $26.10, Grantley $29.61, Thirsk $32.30, Stonebridge $33.25, Kelsall $33.99, Ashgrove $35.70, Verity $35.84, Foxcombe $36.37, Jarrow $37.77, Abbotsley $39.82, Fordwich $39.73, Marlow $43.39, and others. Sellers where XS exists but is disabled/out-of-stock (e.g., Whitlock Outfitters XS at $11.51, Chandler, Holbeck, Thornbury, Fenwick, Redhill, Ivybridge, Oakhurst) were excluded because they cannot actually be bought.",
